# EmailJS Configuration
# Get your credentials from https://www.emailjs.com/
#
# Setup Instructions:
# 1. Create an account at https://www.emailjs.com/
# 2. Go to Email Services and add a service (Gmail, Outlook, etc.)
# 3. Go to Email Templates and create a template with these variables:
#    - {{from_name}} - Sender's name
#    - {{from_email}} - Sender's email
#    - {{to_name}} - Your name (recipient)
#    - {{to_email}} - Your email (recipient)
#    - {{message}} - The message content
# 4. Go to Account > API Keys and copy your Public Key
# 5. Copy this file to .env and replace the values below

VITE_APP_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=your_service_id_here
VITE_APP_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=your_template_id_here
VITE_APP_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_public_key_here
